# AssetIQ API — live requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
# Click "Send Request" above a request. IDs below match a fresh `pnpm seed --reset`.
# Reader ids: 3 = TSAS Main Gate Reader, 1 = TSAS IT Dept Reader, 7 = BAK Depot Gate Reader, 12 = offline reader.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### RFID readers (ids, locations, SBUs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rfid/readers

### 1. Gate scan WITHOUT a pass — raises a pending gate pass + unauthorized_movement alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/rfid/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rfidTag": "RFID-TSAS-0001", "readerId": 3 }

### 2. Pending gate passes (note the new pass id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/gate-passes?status=pending

### 3. Approve it (replace 7 with the id) — records the gate_pass exit, asset goes off-premises
POST {{baseUrl}}/gate-passes/7/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decidedBy": "Rudo Chikwanha", "note": "Client demo" }

### 3b. Approving without a name is rejected (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gate-passes/7/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decidedBy": "  " }

### 4. Scan again at the gate — the asset is off-premises, so this is an ENTRY (no alert)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rfid/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rfidTag": "RFID-TSAS-0001", "readerId": 3 }

### 5. Reject a pass instead — flags the asset (critical alert + note in its history)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gate-passes/5/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decidedBy": "Rudo Chikwanha", "note": "Projector needed on site" }

### 6. Out-of-hours replay: Saturday 02:14 Harare time (00:14 UTC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rfid/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rfidTag": "RFID-TSAS-0005", "readerId": 1, "scannedAt": "2026-10-10T00:14:00Z" }

### 7. Location mismatch: Agricura phone read at the TSAS gate
POST {{baseUrl}}/rfid/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rfidTag": "RFID-AGRI-0025", "readerId": 3 }

### 8. Request a gate pass in advance (manual)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gate-passes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assetId": 2, "requestedBy": "Tendai Moyo", "reason": "Client audit", "destination": "Borrowdale", "returnDate": "2030-01-31" }

### 9. Manual movement
POST {{baseUrl}}/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assetId": 5, "toLocationId": 1, "movedBy": "Farai Ncube", "notes": "Moved for training" }

### 10. Natural-language questions (plan section 6.5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Where is the Dell laptop assigned to John Doe?" }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Which assets have not moved in 30 days?" }

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "question": "Show me all gate passes approved this week" }

### 11. Insights (also runs the idle / missing rules)
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights

### 12. Dashboard data
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/summary

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/movement-trend?days=14

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/gate-activity?limit=10

### 13. Business Central (manual sync only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bc/sync-status

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/bc/sync
